    "text": "<p>Arrange the following in increasing order of reactivity towards nitration</p><p>A. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math>-xylene</p><p>B. bromobenzene</p><p>C. mesitylene</p><p>D.&nbsp;nitrobenzene</p><p>E. benzene</p><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>",
